comments.text:
Root cause: shell snippets occasionally include a literal 
 token as a command separator (e.g. '; 
bd ...'), which shells parse as 
bd => nbd. Fix: add an output post-processor (plugins/village.ts: experimental.text.complete) to convert separator patterns (;/&&/|| + 
) into real newlines inside bash/sh/zsh/shell fenced blocks.
